add(d,'receiving_points','rp-005-native','OpenClaw live mode runs fixed version/models-list/models-status and audit/plan cron-list commands with the selected agent ID, capture_output, no shell and timeout. Native reads can contact configured Gateway/providers and update native caches/logs; exact remote payload and persistence contents are external-contract unknowns.', [('scripts/optimizer.py',26,33),('scripts/optimizer.py',99,109),('SECURITY.md',13,16),('SECURITY.md',30,33)], boundary_type='external_tool possibility / native network and persistence unknowns', recipient='installed OpenClaw and configured Gateway/providers')
